         anchor_delta: SimulationStage,
 
+        /// With anchor_delta > 0: whether a stalled write freezes the pipeline (a stall pipeline whose reads are
+        /// polled with empty(): an empty input issues a bubble, a full output stops every stage). An FRP pipeline's
+        /// writes go to an output buffer instead.
+        anchor_freeze: bool,
+
         /// The key of the [FifoRaw] edge within [EdgeBuilder::incomplete_edges]
         /// whose source should be this write.
